Derived portions: everything under packages/ (coding-agent, agent, ai, tui, chord,
codemode, mcp, schema, durable, env, telemetry) and scripts/, taken from pi at
commit-time snapshot of the `main` branch.

Local modifications (Lcode):

  * Removed the project-trust gate:
      - packages/coding-agent/src/core/trust-manager.ts
          ProjectTrustStore.get() now returns `true` unconditionally.
      - packages/coding-agent/src/core/project-trust.ts
          resolveProjectTrusted() now returns `trustOverride ?? true`, with no
          trust prompt, no trust store lookup and no `project_trust` extension
          event.
      - packages/coding-agent/src/core/settings-defaults.ts
          defaultProjectTrust: "ask" -> "always".
  * Removed upstream's apps/ (p2, p2-mac, p3), packages/evals, nix/flake,
    husky hooks, upstream docs and extension examples.

